WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
Juma Momolu, born in Chicago,
half Nigerian, half Ghanaian.

00:04.800 --> 00:07.300
This was an amazing event.

00:07.300 --> 00:11.200
I think everyone has left
feeling very inspired and knowing that

00:11.200 --> 00:16.000
it's a critical time in our 70 years, and
we're finally able to start industrializing the continent.
